{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Glowing Stones: Heroes' Awakening</strong>\u00a0is an\u00a0Adult Visual Novel\u00a0centering on themes of <strong>Romance</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Friendship</strong>, <strong>Superheroes</strong> and\u00a0<strong>Superpowers</strong> in a dystopian world dominated by powerful megacorporations, where greed and corruption run rampant and there is very little room for kindness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/a54b9789dccd4f43ab055c9960146a43.poster.avif?t=1766344874\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/a54b9789dccd4f43ab055c9960146a43.webm?t=1766344874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 7,000 full-HD images</strong>, crafted with cinematic detail and storytelling in mind.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 minutes of story-driven animations</strong>, complete with immersive sound effects, and <strong>a smooth 60 FPS</strong> experience in the latest chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 minutes of steamy, full-HD lewd animations</strong>, also rendered at <strong>60 FPS</strong> for maximum visual quality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>45 original tracks</strong>, composed by a professional <strong>film composer</strong> exclusively for <i>Glowing Stones: Heroes\u2019 Awakening</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 200 sound effects</strong>, plus dynamic audio layers that bring every scene and animation to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/89c7a2c15cf82923a4d1f08c319a38ae.poster.avif?t=1766344874\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/89c7a2c15cf82923a4d1f08c319a38ae.webm?t=1766344874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You'll be able to meet, and romance, <strong>six beautiful and amazing women</strong>. Each with their own personality, style, and story. Will you romance <strong>all of them</strong> or will you choose to just <strong>stay with one</strong>?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/81f8935e48d888286ef16eeb5b9c65fd.poster.avif?t=1766344874\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/81f8935e48d888286ef16eeb5b9c65fd.webm?t=1766344874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/59ecf532cdd73803b2cb46c1c2f8f6db.poster.avif?t=1766344874\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/59ecf532cdd73803b2cb46c1c2f8f6db.webm?t=1766344874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to rely on those like Greg, your best friend and/or rely on his beautiful wife, Sheila, as well as rely on a lot of other characters that can help you along during your incredible journey! Allowing you to experience lot of their stories\u2026 some sad, some kind and some... quite erotic.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/11ee3a7c2f8910da48df4c78f22260de.poster.avif?t=1766344874\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/11ee3a7c2f8910da48df4c78f22260de.webm?t=1766344874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The true value of a hero is measured by the strength of his enemi! And in this game you\u2019ll meet and find many of them! <br>And, for sure, it will not always be easy for you to win those fights! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/01da3c3bf6d05c93d54d80cc3e5a5c6a.poster.avif?t=1766344874\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/01da3c3bf6d05c93d54d80cc3e5a5c6a.webm?t=1766344874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world within this story is somewhere between our own and a <strong>contemporary cyberpunk</strong> one.  <br>A world where the mega corporations that exist are more powerful than the governments of the world and tend to dictate policies and laws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>MoonCity, the town in which this story takes place, is a mix between a luminous and wonderous city and a dark and rough megapolis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/515075db241906427c7cda12fd0c9416.poster.avif?t=1766344874\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/515075db241906427c7cda12fd0c9416.webm?t=1766344874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262220/extras/515075db241906427c7cda12fd0c9416.mp4?t=1766344874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you'll have access to a <strong>texting system</strong> which will allow the girls to send you some pictures and messages, if you manage to please them enough. There will also <strong>galleries</strong> for the characters and their biographies with <strong>bonus pictures</strong> you'll be able to unlock during your adventure, as well as a <strong>replay gallery</strong> that will allow you to replay all of the erotic and story point scenes of the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The roommate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262220/d8c655312f57dca4f37820a05c2ee307b63b85eb.jpg"},{"name":"The girl next door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262220/bd05eed42a5e4455411dbdc94f921127b3c25e60.jpg"},{"name":"The kindest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262220/0e7cdd6f62af574d14b286f8daa46ec732416331.jpg"},{"name":"The Bravery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262220/b179ddbb9f49c1ac00d333a13c3d723f544b19e9.jpg"},{"name":"The Best Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262220/ccd45cb40fd739cfbd44e2f9521feec281b9037a.jpg"},{"name":"The burning flame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262220/45b35546c1a0760df364b62921ae307dbf428e2b.jpg"},{"name":"The homeless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262220/c53c67ebc85ad7d325301da81ad2ead04cb13de1.jpg"},{"name":"The journalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262220